Below is a complete, production‑ready blueprint you can copy‑paste and extend.
It shows how to turn the one‑page demo you posted into a full‑stack CV‑Builder platform with:

a dark, responsive UI & navigation drawer,
a solid login / sign‑up flow,
verified‑only PDF download,
50+ template styles,
robust security (HTTPS, CSP, rate‑limit, brute‑force protection, CSRF, XSS, SQL‑injection defence, JWT + HttpOnly cookies, etc.),
audit logging of every login / sign‑up attempt,
a clean dashboard where users can pick a template, edit fields, add custom sections and preview live,
a server‑side PDF generator (Puppeteer) that respects the chosen template.
